    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Army de Châlons (French: \"Armée de Châlons (1870)\" ) was a French military unit that fought during the Franco-Prussian War of 1870. Formed in the camp of Châlons on August 17, 1870 from elements of the Army of the Rhin (1870) (French: \"\" ) which the unit was issued from, the Army of Châlons was engaged in combats of Beaumont and Sedan while disappearing during the capitulation of September 2, 1870.",
      "depth": 0,
